    "created_at": "2021-05-12T10:35:11Z",
    "updated_at": "2021-05-12T10:36:54Z",
    "body": "I see only one problem: For input type=range there is an example in the specification where it is shown that list and datalist is not used for suggestions, but only for a label: https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/input.html#range-state-(type=range)",
