    "created_at": "2021-05-12T10:47:05Z",
    "updated_at": "2021-05-12T10:47:05Z",
    "body": "Even if a label is displayed, this is not automatically a suggestion. And would also not work like datalist for input type=text, where a combobox is shown to the user and he/she can explicitly select the values. This doesn't work with type=range, there is no support to hit exactly the value as well",
