    "created_at": "2021-05-12T10:49:51Z",
    "updated_at": "2021-05-12T10:49:51Z",
    "body": "In addition, the list attribute creates [accessibility problems](https://github.com/w3c/html-aam/issues/332) that have not yet been solved. ",
